rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">400</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">39</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">环绕尘世的巨蟒早已失去自己的毒牙。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">吞噬神父的狂狼也找不回自己的心脏。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">冥府的使者，就算是你，也无力在亡者之国的深渊中扇动羽翼。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">永恒的女士，您才是这冥河上唯一的渡舟人，请慷慨赐下那满载回忆的迷迭香，为我们指明生者的方向。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">唤魂者</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:25秒]在自身周围释放一圈夺魂迷雾击飞敌人，造成400%攻击力雷电元素伤害，并获得以下效果：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">令失落迷迭直接进入【冥府魔女】形态，获得【狼】【枭】【蛇】三个印，并回复全部魂灵</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">身陷迷雾的敌人会陷入【失魂】状态，【蛇之印】的周期性雷电对【失魂】状态的敌人额外造成80.0%攻击力雷电元素伤害，持续15秒</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">每次使用蓄力攻击，自身全伤害提升25.0%， 持续15秒 ( 该效果无法叠加 )</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">引路香</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色蓄力攻击和必杀技造成的雷电元素伤害提升30.0%，自身对处于【恶戏咒纹】的敌人全伤害增加40.0%</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">倒转冥河</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">失落迷迭携带时拥有以下效果：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">开启必杀技期间角色触发时滞领域效果，角色、敌人身上的技能效果以及关卡都会停止计时</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">诡计之神的施法时间缩短为2秒，攻击范围大幅提升，施法期间所有敌人的行动速度都将大幅降低</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/322/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/10/30/77124895/d06885d9acee7e27fa4d7927d898b665_4106328385598691107.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「安息鸢尾」图鉴后任意镰刀蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2250%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%88%B1%E5%9B%A0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%8E%AF%E7%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%22%2C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A9%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fconten